entity.description:
A public account's grant as a contact of an outside party (a customer, a supplier) on one app of one
            organization's site, made by redeeming an invite#Contact invitation. The Billing and Supplier pages check it;
            a CRM contact relationship gives no portal access, and the account holds no user group.

field.description:
The organization the delivery is from (a seller's quote, Sales P10;
      a campaign's, Marketing P9), whose suppressions it meets beside every organization's; empty: its store's organization, when
      it names a store (impl-marketing P3 review).
